WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Traceability. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Link needs, design and evidence

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Traceability links need → requirement → design choice → verification evidence. It reveals missing proof.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: If a requirement has no test or analysis method attached, its verification path is incomplete.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Traceability chain

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Link needs, design and evidence
